name: ['Auramancer', "Black Sun's Zenith", 'Boggart Ram-Gang', 'Boomerang', 'Calciderm', 'Celestine Reef', "Cenn's Tactician", 'Circle of Flame', 'Curse of Wizardry', 'Dauntless Dourbark', 'Deathless Angel', 'Drench the Soil in Their Blood', 'Duergar Hedge-Mage', 'Dungrove Elder', 'Emeria Angel', 'Fiery Temper', 'Fling', "Golem's Heart", 'Gravedigger', 'Hada Freeblade', 'Hellspark Elemental', 'Horizon Boughs', 'Icatian Javelineers', 'Imprison This Insolent Wretch', 'Kalastria Highborn', 'Kor Duelist', 'Kor Firewalker', 'Lava Axe', 'Leatherback Baloth', "Liliana's Specter", 'Llanowar Elves', "Marisi's Twinclaws", "Master's Call", 'Maul Splicer', 'Memnite', 'Mind Control', 'Mind Stone', 'Mirrored Depths', 'Mitotic Slime', 'Mogg Fanatic', 'Mycoid Shepherd', 'Myr Superion', 'Naya Sojourners', "Nissa's Chosen", "Oona's Blackguard", 'Path to Exile', 'Pathrazer of Ulamog', "Perhaps You've Met My Cohort", 'Plague Myr', 'Plague Stinger', 'Plots That Span Centuries', 'Priest of Urabrask', 'Reckless Wurm', 'Rise from the Grave', 'Selkie Hedge-Mage', 'Shrine of Burning Rage', 'Signal Pest', 'Skinrender', 'Slave of Bolas', 'Sprouting Thrinax', 'Staggershock', 'Stormblood Berserker', 'Sylvan Ranger', 'Syphon Mind', 'Tazeem', 'Tember City', 'Tempered Steel', 'Tormented Soul', 'Treasure Mage', 'Vampire Nighthawk', 'Vault Skirge', 'Wilt-Leaf Cavaliers', 'Wood Elves', 'Woolly Thoctar', 'Yixlid Jailer', 'Your Inescapable Doom', 'Zoetic Cavern']
